1
00:00:07,240 --> 00:00:12,080
=Fatal Proximity to Him=

2
00:00:12,080 --> 00:00:14,120
=Episode 15=

3
00:00:18,880 --> 00:00:20,640
Li Junsheng's making fake drugs,

4
00:00:20,760 --> 00:00:21,920
and someone already died
because of those drugs?

5
00:00:23,560 --> 00:00:24,600
I looked into it.

6
00:00:25,440 --> 00:00:26,640
I think he's making

7
00:00:26,640 --> 00:00:27,880
a generic version of sofosbuvir.

8
00:00:28,760 --> 00:00:30,960
The cytidine he stole
from Wang Haotian's factory

9
00:00:31,280 --> 00:00:32,120
is one of the raw materials.

10
00:00:33,600 --> 00:00:34,840
I used to think

11
00:00:35,440 --> 00:00:36,960
that no matter how awful he was,

12
00:00:37,200 --> 00:00:38,480
as long as we stayed out of his way,

13
00:00:38,800 --> 00:00:39,760
we could just ride it out.

14
00:00:40,800 --> 00:00:42,400
But after what he's done,

15
00:00:42,840 --> 00:00:44,640
we can't just stand by
and let him do harm to people.

16
00:00:45,280 --> 00:00:46,520
I secretly recorded a video.

17
00:00:47,600 --> 00:00:49,200
It may not count as direct evidence,

18
00:00:49,480 --> 00:00:50,640
but I think the police

19
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:52,200
will know what to do with it.

20
00:00:55,160 --> 00:00:57,720
(Good Fortune)

21
00:01:01,640 --> 00:01:02,360
You little brat!

22
00:01:02,360 --> 00:01:03,440
You have the nerve to come back?

23
00:01:03,800 --> 00:01:04,200
Huh?

24
00:01:04,280 --> 00:01:05,680
I know you hate Junsheng,

25
00:01:06,200 --> 00:01:07,800
but you got him thrown in jail!

26
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:09,000
About Wang Haotian...

27
00:01:09,160 --> 00:01:09,640
Yes,

28
00:01:09,640 --> 00:01:10,720
you were falsely accused.

29
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:13,040
But I still scrambled to get the money
to bail you out!

30
00:01:13,200 --> 00:01:14,800
It cost me over a hundred grand!

31
00:01:15,200 --> 00:01:16,560
You saw what I did for you.

32
00:01:16,640 --> 00:01:17,400
And now?

33
00:01:17,400 --> 00:01:18,560
This is how you repay me?

34
00:01:18,600 --> 00:01:19,800
Get your facts straight, will you?

35
00:01:20,240 --> 00:01:21,280
Were you really trying to protect me?

36
00:01:22,320 --> 00:01:24,160
You really didn't know Li Junsheng
framed me?

37
00:01:24,200 --> 00:01:24,760
Besides,

38
00:01:24,760 --> 00:01:26,320
you keep pushing
for a private settlement

39
00:01:26,640 --> 00:01:28,000
because you just want this whole thing
to go away!

40
00:01:28,160 --> 00:01:28,480
You...

41
00:01:28,600 --> 00:01:29,440
Still making excuses?

42
00:01:30,120 --> 00:01:31,080
I'm telling you,

43
00:01:31,400 --> 00:01:33,600
you ruined your precious son
by spoiling him rotten.

44
00:01:34,040 --> 00:01:35,160
You'll regret it someday.

45
00:01:35,440 --> 00:01:36,160
What did you say?

46
00:01:36,360 --> 00:01:36,760
You...

47
00:01:36,760 --> 00:01:38,000
You think you can defy me now?

48
00:01:38,040 --> 00:01:38,760
Get back out here!

49
00:01:38,760 --> 00:01:39,560
You little brat!

50
00:01:39,720 --> 00:01:40,680
I'm not letting you off!

51
00:01:40,760 --> 00:01:41,600
Enough! Stop it!

52
00:01:41,600 --> 00:01:42,000
Come on. Let's go.

53
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:42,960
What are you doing?

54
00:01:48,800 --> 00:01:50,200
Li Junsheng's been detained.

55
00:01:50,680 --> 00:01:51,760
The lawyer says

56
00:01:52,480 --> 00:01:53,960
he'll get at least twelve years.

57
00:01:54,840 --> 00:01:56,200
Twelve years?

58
00:01:56,960 --> 00:01:57,760
That means

59
00:01:57,760 --> 00:01:59,600
on April 4, 2025,

60
00:01:59,600 --> 00:02:00,520
he'll still be in prison.

61
00:02:01,800 --> 00:02:03,000
We solved the crisis.

62
00:02:03,120 --> 00:02:04,160
We changed our fate.

63
00:02:04,240 --> 00:02:04,640
Yeah.

64
00:02:05,040 --> 00:02:06,880
By saving those people,

65
00:02:06,880 --> 00:02:08,400
we ended up saving ourselves too.

66
00:02:09,360 --> 00:02:10,000
Maybe

67
00:02:10,280 --> 00:02:11,720
this was fate all along.

68
00:02:12,120 --> 00:02:13,280
So, from here on out,

69
00:02:13,600 --> 00:02:14,240
you just

70
00:02:14,280 --> 00:02:16,280
live the life you were meant to live.

71
00:02:18,480 --> 00:02:19,280
How's your ankle?

72
00:02:19,640 --> 00:02:20,520
Your arts exam is coming up.

73
00:02:21,080 --> 00:02:22,720
It's completely healed now.

74
00:02:23,400 --> 00:02:24,240
I'm telling you,

75
00:02:24,320 --> 00:02:26,120
that arts exam?

76
00:02:26,480 --> 00:02:27,560
I've got it in the bag now.

77
00:02:31,520 --> 00:02:32,120
Well then,

78
00:02:32,320 --> 00:02:33,280
on the day of the exam,

79
00:02:33,680 --> 00:02:34,480
I'll take you there.

80
00:02:34,480 --> 00:02:35,160
Okay?

81
00:02:35,360 --> 00:02:35,840
Okay.

82
00:02:44,960 --> 00:02:46,240
Ranked No. 1 nationwide!

83
00:02:46,240 --> 00:02:46,880
Xiyu!

84
00:02:47,080 --> 00:02:47,960
Number one!

85
00:02:49,320 --> 00:02:50,240
What's with that face?

86
00:02:50,240 --> 00:02:51,640
Why aren't you reacting at all?

87
00:02:51,640 --> 00:02:52,480
I'm freaking out over here!

88
00:02:52,480 --> 00:02:53,600
How are you not excited?

89
00:02:53,600 --> 00:02:54,440
I am excited!

90
00:02:54,800 --> 00:02:55,640
And of course,

91
00:02:55,760 --> 00:02:58,280
congratulations are also in order
for Song Shuqi,

92
00:02:58,400 --> 00:03:00,040
who got her acceptance letter too.

93
00:03:00,040 --> 00:03:01,120
She just happened to rank...

94
00:03:01,200 --> 00:03:02,120
twenty-second.

95
00:03:02,120 --> 00:03:02,400
(Admission Notice)

96
00:03:04,760 --> 00:03:05,800
What's wrong with twenty-second?

97
00:03:05,880 --> 00:03:06,880
I still got in.

98
00:03:07,200 --> 00:03:08,880
You should worry about your own grades

99
00:03:08,880 --> 00:03:09,880
and whether you'll even get
into college.

100
00:03:09,880 --> 00:03:10,280
You...

101
00:03:10,280 --> 00:03:10,880
Enough.

102
00:03:11,480 --> 00:03:13,240
It's a happy day. Don't fight.

103
00:03:13,720 --> 00:03:14,200
Okay.

104
00:03:14,800 --> 00:03:16,440
Tomorrow's Xiyu's birthday.

105
00:03:16,520 --> 00:03:18,040
So to celebrate both pieces
of good news,

106
00:03:18,040 --> 00:03:19,480
I hereby declare that tomorrow,

107
00:03:19,520 --> 00:03:20,800
(Admission Notice)
we're having barbecue together!

108
00:03:22,640 --> 00:03:23,720
Thanks, boss!

109
00:03:24,880 --> 00:03:25,520
Shuqi,

110
00:03:26,040 --> 00:03:27,360
come with us tomorrow.

111
00:03:27,720 --> 00:03:29,400
We'll celebrate getting into
the Dance Academy together.

112
00:03:29,720 --> 00:03:31,000
Why would I go?

113
00:03:31,680 --> 00:03:33,320
Everyone knows tomorrow's all about you.

114
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:35,120
You want me there as your sidekick?

115
00:03:35,640 --> 00:03:36,320
I'll pass.

116
00:03:37,400 --> 00:03:38,200
Why'd you even invite her?

117
00:03:40,720 --> 00:03:41,760
Tomorrow's barbecue

118
00:03:42,840 --> 00:03:43,680
is on me.

119
00:03:43,680 --> 00:03:44,800
Great!

120
00:03:58,400 --> 00:04:01,040
(I hope He Lan and I can be happy
together)

121
00:04:01,360 --> 00:04:03,560
(and embrace the bright future
ahead of us.)

122
00:04:07,440 --> 00:04:08,920
Happy birthday!

123
00:04:08,920 --> 00:04:09,960
Happy birthday, Xiyu!

124
00:04:09,960 --> 00:04:10,480
Thank you.

125
00:04:10,480 --> 00:04:11,440
Happy birthday!

126
00:04:11,520 --> 00:04:12,440
Thank you.

127
00:04:12,440 --> 00:04:13,040
Xiyu,

128
00:04:13,520 --> 00:04:15,200
happy birthday.

129
00:04:20,760 --> 00:04:21,880
Happy 18th birthday.

130
00:04:40,400 --> 00:04:41,440
Thank you, everyone.

131
00:04:42,640 --> 00:04:44,720
I'm just so happy right now.

132
00:04:45,200 --> 00:04:46,160
This is

133
00:04:46,160 --> 00:04:47,280
the most perfect

134
00:04:47,560 --> 00:04:48,800
18th birthday I could ask for.

135
00:04:49,680 --> 00:04:50,440
He Lan,

136
00:04:50,800 --> 00:04:52,360
you really went all out.

137
00:04:52,600 --> 00:04:53,800
Must be nice being rich.

138
00:04:54,120 --> 00:04:55,200
Well, don't mind if I do.

139
00:04:55,560 --> 00:04:56,240
Excuse me!

140
00:04:56,240 --> 00:04:57,640
Get her a grilled fish!

141
00:04:58,400 --> 00:05:00,040
That's my girl!

142
00:05:01,400 --> 00:05:03,160
Since when have you ever
held back around food?

143
00:05:04,160 --> 00:05:04,840
Give me that.

144
00:05:13,360 --> 00:05:14,040
Class monitor,

145
00:05:15,000 --> 00:05:17,400
I sense danger in the air.

146
00:05:19,200 --> 00:05:20,240
Just eat.

147
00:05:21,680 --> 00:05:22,120
Here.

148
00:05:22,480 --> 00:05:23,480
Have one.

149
00:05:24,920 --> 00:05:25,400
Three,

150
00:05:25,480 --> 00:05:25,960
two,

151
00:05:25,960 --> 00:05:26,560
one!

152
00:05:26,640 --> 00:05:27,640
(Enter Quietly; Study Hard; Stay Focused)
We

153
00:05:27,680 --> 00:05:29,480
graduated!

154
00:06:05,440 --> 00:06:09,240
(2015)

155
00:06:33,600 --> 00:06:34,200
He Lan,

156
00:06:34,240 --> 00:06:35,720
here to study with Xiyu again?

157
00:06:36,360 --> 00:06:37,040
What?

158
00:06:37,080 --> 00:06:38,480
Is the library at your top university

159
00:06:38,640 --> 00:06:40,840
not as good as ours
at the Dance Academy?

160
00:06:42,400 --> 00:06:43,600
Where I study doesn't matter.

161
00:06:44,200 --> 00:06:45,240
What matters is...

162
00:06:47,000 --> 00:06:48,280
keeping my girlfriend company.

163
00:06:49,880 --> 00:06:51,000
(Psychology of Leadership)
You two are too sweet.

164
00:06:51,000 --> 00:06:52,080
Besides,

165
00:06:52,080 --> 00:06:53,320
finals week is almost here.

166
00:06:53,760 --> 00:06:54,760
Seriously, too sweet.

167
00:06:55,240 --> 00:06:56,280
(Psychology of Leadership)
By the way, Song Shuqi,

168
00:06:56,480 --> 00:06:57,400
where's your boyfriend?

169
00:06:57,760 --> 00:06:59,440
Why haven't you brought him
around to meet us?

170
00:07:00,840 --> 00:07:02,400
He's a med student.

171
00:07:02,640 --> 00:07:04,440
He's with his professor saving lives
every day.

172
00:07:04,440 --> 00:07:05,560
He doesn't have time for this.

173
00:07:06,040 --> 00:07:07,080
As his girlfriend,

174
00:07:07,120 --> 00:07:08,440
of course I fully support him.

175
00:07:09,240 --> 00:07:10,000
Okay.

176
00:07:10,640 --> 00:07:11,040
Oh!

177
00:07:11,560 --> 00:07:12,480
I'm off. Bye!

178
00:07:18,440 --> 00:07:22,000
(Fintech City Development Plan
2019)

179
00:07:52,800 --> 00:07:54,920
(Fintech City Development Plan)

180
00:08:02,680 --> 00:08:06,200
(2023)

181
00:08:12,720 --> 00:08:14,600
(Client Needs
and Industry Environment Analysis)

182
00:08:29,920 --> 00:08:33,320
(2025)

183
00:08:37,520 --> 00:08:38,560
Congratulations to my girlfriend

184
00:08:39,000 --> 00:08:40,520
on making it into
the Xinghai Ballet Company.

185
00:08:46,040 --> 00:08:46,840
What's this?

186
00:08:49,920 --> 00:08:50,840
From now on,

187
00:08:51,760 --> 00:08:53,000
this place is our home.

188
00:08:54,920 --> 00:08:56,480
Wow, Mr. He, that's impressive.

189
00:08:59,440 --> 00:09:01,200
But my mom said

190
00:09:01,600 --> 00:09:03,040
we can't live together
before we're married.

191
00:09:04,080 --> 00:09:05,560
She wants to keep me around
a few more years.

192
00:09:07,000 --> 00:09:07,640
Then...

193
00:09:08,200 --> 00:09:10,000
can we celebrate Valentine's Day here

194
00:09:10,040 --> 00:09:11,200
this Friday?

195
00:09:11,600 --> 00:09:12,080
But...

196
00:09:12,080 --> 00:09:13,680
I have to leave on a business trip
the day after tomorrow.

197
00:09:13,760 --> 00:09:15,040
I won't be back until Friday.

198
00:09:15,840 --> 00:09:17,920
So I might not make it back
for Valentine's Day.

199
00:09:18,360 --> 00:09:19,120
It's okay.

200
00:09:22,960 --> 00:09:24,120
I was just thinking

201
00:09:25,280 --> 00:09:25,800
these past ten years,

202
00:09:25,800 --> 00:09:27,480
we've hardly ever been apart.

203
00:09:30,920 --> 00:09:31,760
So what do we do?

204
00:09:33,720 --> 00:09:34,760
Nothing we can do.

205
00:09:36,400 --> 00:09:37,960
My girlfriend's going to be

206
00:09:38,080 --> 00:09:40,240
one of the best dancers
in the country someday.

207
00:09:41,480 --> 00:09:43,600
You'll be touring all over the country,

208
00:09:43,800 --> 00:09:45,320
maybe even overseas.

209
00:09:46,480 --> 00:09:47,560
I'll just have to get used to it.

210
00:10:00,680 --> 00:10:03,440
(April 4, 2025; Swan Lake
Luo Xiyu, Principal Dancer)

211
00:10:05,160 --> 00:10:06,400
I actually got here a while ago.

212
00:10:06,920 --> 00:10:07,920
I just...

213
00:10:07,960 --> 00:10:11,120
sat in the corner and watched
your whole performance.

214
00:10:11,600 --> 00:10:13,360
I didn't see you while I was dancing.

215
00:10:13,360 --> 00:10:15,320
I thought work kept you from coming.

216
00:10:16,240 --> 00:10:18,840
It's your first time performing
as principal dancer.

217
00:10:19,160 --> 00:10:20,360
How could I miss it?

218
00:10:21,640 --> 00:10:23,520
You're just filling in as principal.

219
00:10:24,080 --> 00:10:25,680
Don't start thinking
you actually are one.

220
00:10:28,960 --> 00:10:29,720
That's enough.

221
00:10:30,160 --> 00:10:31,440
Give it a rest.

222
00:10:32,120 --> 00:10:33,720
Whose boyfriend are you, anyway?

223
00:10:33,880 --> 00:10:35,720
Why are you always
taking Luo Xiyu's side?

224
00:10:40,680 --> 00:10:41,200
It's okay,

225
00:10:41,200 --> 00:10:41,800
Shuqi.

226
00:10:42,600 --> 00:10:43,440
I'm on your side.

227
00:10:44,360 --> 00:10:46,960
When you finally get to fill in
as principal,

228
00:10:47,840 --> 00:10:48,920
I'll have Jinghang

229
00:10:49,240 --> 00:10:50,280
send you two bouquets.

230
00:10:59,800 --> 00:11:00,480
(Dr. Zhang,)

231
00:11:00,520 --> 00:11:01,600
(your mother is suddenly
in critical condition.)

232
00:11:01,600 --> 00:11:02,600
(We're performing emergency treatment.)

233
00:11:02,640 --> 00:11:03,480
(Come back to the hospital now.)

234
00:11:34,200 --> 00:11:39,080
♪I hide my racing heart without a sound♪

235
00:11:41,000 --> 00:11:45,640
♪I close my eyes and pretend
the story's been reset♪

236
00:11:47,120 --> 00:11:49,760
♪I steer clear of every path
that leads to you♪

237
00:11:50,120 --> 00:11:52,920
♪Trying to outrun the storm
we're destined for♪

238
00:11:53,600 --> 00:11:55,840
♪I thought if I didn't hear, see,
or speak of you♪

239
00:11:55,840 --> 00:11:59,320
♪I could cut every thread
that ties us together♪

240
00:12:00,480 --> 00:12:05,560
♪Through the endless night,
I guard my only secret♪

241
00:12:07,040 --> 00:12:12,120
♪In this new cycle, I watch you
become innocent again♪

242
00:12:13,240 --> 00:12:15,400
♪I tried to erase the fire we once had♪

243
00:12:15,400 --> 00:12:19,280
♪But I can't erase your name
carved into my bones♪

244
00:12:19,880 --> 00:12:22,120
♪The more I try to leave you behind♪

245
00:12:22,120 --> 00:12:26,240
♪The deeper I sink with no end in sight♪

246
00:12:26,400 --> 00:12:29,120
♪What if I stayed a little farther away♪

247
00:12:29,120 --> 00:12:32,520
♪Could I finally break free
from this cycle♪

248
00:12:32,920 --> 00:12:34,920
♪What if I took things a little slower♪

249
00:12:34,920 --> 00:12:38,920
♪Could I delay the moment
everything falls apart♪

250
00:12:39,160 --> 00:12:43,000
♪Maybe if I retreat to the edge
of my dreams♪

251
00:12:43,000 --> 00:12:46,040
♪I could give you another future♪

252
00:12:46,240 --> 00:12:52,480
♪A tomorrow where I no longer exist♪

253
00:12:52,480 --> 00:12:54,800
♪Even if I never want to see you again♪

254
00:12:54,800 --> 00:12:56,440
♪This nightmare still won't end♪

255
00:12:56,440 --> 00:12:58,200
♪Even if it all plays out again♪

256
00:12:58,200 --> 00:13:00,480
♪I'll still find my way back to you♪

257
00:13:00,480 --> 00:13:04,480
♪Even if having you only leaves me
in your debt♪

258
00:13:04,480 --> 00:13:08,440
♪It's still better than
losing you forever♪
